; Models: a hand clap, three quick bursts of bandpassed noise and a short room tail | Neglects: the hands themselves | IO: (t) -> amplitude | Tags: drum
crop(0.9*tanh(4*(bandpass(sample(rand(t, seed=21)), cutoff=1150, q=1.3)*(exp(-t/0.003) + 0.9*step(t - 0.010)*exp(-(t - 0.010)/0.003) + 0.8*step(t - 0.021)*exp(-(t - 0.021)/0.004) + 0.75*step(t - 0.030)*exp(-(t - 0.030)/0.11)) + 0.4*highpass(sample(rand(t, seed=22)), cutoff=3500, q=0.7)*step(t - 0.030)*exp(-(t - 0.030)/0.06))), 0s, 0.5s, rise=0.0002s, fall=0.1s)
